			"notes": "Fabric client port of Meowtils for **Minecraft 26.2**.\n\n## Mod\n\n- `meowtils-1.0.1.jar` — put this in your instance `mods` folder with Fabric Loader and Fabric API.\n- `MeowtilsAutoUpdate.jar` — helper used by Auto-Updates. Do **not** put it in `mods`.\n\n## Example extensions\n\nThese `.meowtils` archives were built against this exact Meowtils version. After the first launch, copy any of them into `<minecraft>/meowtils/extensions/` and restart (or `/reload` if the base mod is already this build).\n\n| File | What it is |\n| --- | --- |\n| `hello-extension.meowtils` | Starter example: settings, `/hello`, chat trigger, HUD |\n| `tenacity-gui.meowtils` | Floating panels, themes, search, original widgets (enabled by default) |\n| `notifications.meowtils` | Tenacity 5.0 and Vape V4 notification styles (enabled by default) |\n| `bed-plates.meowtils` | Projected bed-defense item plates (disabled by default) |\n| `stats-faker.meowtils` | Local Bedwars/network display changes (disabled by default) |\n\nUse these only with this Meowtils jar. Open the Click GUI with **Right Shift**.\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/brrock/meowtils-modern/compare/v1.0.0...v1.0.1"
		},
